DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The eeffii driver provides support for EFI runtime services offered by UEFI
     firmware implementations.  It can read and write the Real Time Clock and
     provides userland applications ioctl(2) access to the System Resource Ta‐
     ble and to read and write variables.

IIOOCCTTLLSS
     eeffii supports the following ioctl(2) commands, available through
     <_d_e_v_/_e_f_i_/_e_f_i_._h> <_d_e_v_/_e_f_i_/_e_f_i_i_o_._h>:

